# Faz o clangd usar os includes do GCC (libstdc++), para #include <bits/stdc++.h>.
# Caminhos inexistentes sao ignorados pelo clang, entao os dois SOs convivem aqui.
#
# -nostdinc++ e obrigatorio: sem ele o clangd mistura a libc++ dele com a
# libstdc++ do GCC e enche o arquivo de erros falsos de "reference is ambiguous".
#
# macOS: GCC do Homebrew. Se atualizar para o GCC 17, troque "16" pelo novo major
# e ajuste "aarch64-apple-darwin25" conforme `g++-16 -dumpmachine`.
# Windows (MSYS2 UCRT64): troque o --target para x86_64-w64-windows-gnu.
CompileFlags:
  Add:
    - -std=c++20
    - --target=arm64-apple-darwin
    - -nostdinc++
    - -isystem
    - /opt/homebrew/include/c++/16
    - -isystem
    - /opt/homebrew/include/c++/16/aarch64-apple-darwin25
    - -isystem
    - /opt/homebrew/include/c++/16/backward
    - -isystem
    - C:/msys64/ucrt64/include/c++/15.2.0
    - -isystem
    - C:/msys64/ucrt64/include/c++/15.2.0/x86_64-w64-mingw32
    - -isystem
    - C:/msys64/ucrt64/include/c++/15.2.0/backward
    - -isystem
    - C:/msys64/ucrt64/include
